The `is_subpath` function correctly enforces path containment and avoids directory traversal by normalizing paths and checking subpath relationships. While edge cases exist, they do not constitute exploitable vulnerabilities under standard usage scenarios. The function adheres to the security guidelines for validating `dest_path`.

